## Check that it works

Run these checks from any computer once the package is deployed. In each command, replace `your-article-path` with the path of one of your licensed pages. The console runs the same checks for you on its **Connect your site** step.

In the first check, a 403 is the expected result, not an error: it means the package refuses AI agents that have no licence.

GPTBot, which the checks use, is one of many AI agents. OpenAI alone runs several: https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/bots. You do not need to list them: the package recognises AI agents by the names they send.{{with .BotVerification}} {{.}}{{end}}
