## When your domain is verified

Your domain is verified when all three of these are in place:

- The domain's terms are set on the console's **Your terms** step.
- This package is deployed, refuses AI agents (check 1) and lets people through (check 2).
- Your discovery file is served at https://{{.Domain}}/.well-known/fora.json, and AI agents can read it (check 3). It is the fora.json you downloaded beside this package; serve it as it is.

The console verifies the domain on its **Connect your site** step, when it checks your site and finds all of this in place. To open that step, press **Finish setup** on the domain's page in the console. While the terms are not set, **Finish setup** opens the **Your terms** step first.

